<p>Fire out a spear of cosmic energies. If it hits an enemy it deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">209, 281, 337, 384, 426</acronym> damage, otherwise it explodes in a thin cone of radius 4 at the end of its range, blocked by enemies, which deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">83, 112, 135, 154, 171</acronym> to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">209, 281, 337, 384, 426</acronym> damage depending on how much the enemies block.</p>